      "content": "i don't want a \"cleaner world\" or \"healing.\" i just want the weight to stop. i'm so tired of fighting a system that only rewards the people who lied. it feels like i'm just watching the world go on without me, and honestly, it would be easier if i just wasn't part of it anymore. it feels like there's no way back from this.",
